(6970564, 1051957, 124190, '<td valign="top">I''m taking a chance here.   So please forgive me father..... I may not know what I do BUT......    this is something that you obviously spent a lot of time on....like the concept, sky, goats, herder (I like his wrist ornament....is there a name for that?  it''s very cool....)...........it would be my top pick except for how much the angel looks like a concrete...lawn ornament.......    it just makes me laugh....ug and I don''t want to laugh....I want to see an ethereal, faint, wispy angel that I have to strain my eyes to see...THAT would give me the shivers..... perhaps coming out of the shapes of a cloud.... :-) high mark.......</td>', 'I''m taking a chance here.   So please forgive me father..... I may not know what I do BUT......    this is something that you obviously spent a lot of time on....like the concept, sky, goats, herder (I like his wrist ornament....is there a name for that?  it''s very cool....)...........it would be my top pick except for how much the angel looks like a concrete...lawn ornament.......    it just makes me laugh....ug and I don''t want to laugh....I want to see an ethereal, faint, wispy angel that I have to strain my eyes to see...THAT would give me the shivers..... perhaps coming out of the shapes of a cloud.... :-) high mark.......', '2013-02-03 11:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
