(6971723, 1052010, 112739, '<td valign="top">Really well done, the water is fantastic. Reminds me of a place called the Subway in SW Utah. Slot canyons get eroded over ions of time and come to look just like this. Well, minus the hallowed leader.</td>', 'Really well done, the water is fantastic. Reminds me of a place called the Subway in SW Utah. Slot canyons get eroded over ions of time and come to look just like this. Well, minus the hallowed leader.', '2013-02-04 14:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972036, 1052053, 155129, '<td valign="top">strong one</td>', 'strong one', '2013-02-04 23:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972059, 1052080, 77196, '<td valign="top">First up for me. Great image - love the "wee bit wild" look, muscled arm in the foreground. Picky - I think he used a donkey''s jawbone, not a leg or arm bone. Still cool.</td>', 'First up for me. Great image - love the "wee bit wild" look, muscled arm in the foreground. Picky - I think he used a donkey''s jawbone, not a leg or arm bone. Still cool.', '2013-02-05 00:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972062, 1052153, 77196, '<td valign="top">I really like your use of light vs. darkness in this shot. Harsh shadows. Bright, almost too hot light. I also like the expression on Salome''s face - it shows she really isn''t into this "present", even though she asked for it.</td>', 'I really like your use of light vs. darkness in this shot. Harsh shadows. Bright, almost too hot light. I also like the expression on Salome''s face - it shows she really isn''t into this "present", even though she asked for it.', '2013-02-05 00:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972065, 1052169, 77196, '<td valign="top">Masterfully done. Love the interaction of light and dark (but not too dark). Love the "wind" in angel''s hair &amp; dress. Interesting that while tradition has angels as women, the angels in the Bible all appeared to be men. Great job on Jacob''s costume too - even though his whites look a bit too white, it is potential allegory for righteous, so it gets a pass regardless. Nice shot.</td>', 'Masterfully done. Love the interaction of light and dark (but not too dark). Love the "wind" in angel''s hair & dress. Interesting that while tradition has angels as women, the angels in the Bible all appeared to be men. Great job on Jacob''s costume too - even though his whites look a bit too white, it is potential allegory for righteous, so it gets a pass regardless. Nice shot.', '2013-02-05 00:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972066, 1052118, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure this is historically accurate, but it is a powerful image anyhow. Yes, Jesus was a rebel against the religious leaders, but a staunch conservative on the Mosaic law. An interesting combination, without a doubt. Great use of the leather jacket, nail wounds, halo, and angels faintly in the corners.</td>', 'Not sure this is historically accurate, but it is a powerful image anyhow. Yes, Jesus was a rebel against the religious leaders, but a staunch conservative on the Mosaic law. An interesting combination, without a doubt. Great use of the leather jacket, nail wounds, halo, and angels faintly in the corners.', '2013-02-05 00:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972067, 1051905, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, well executed. Great color in the sunrise, and nice constrast against the ground, which is lit just enough by the lightening sky.</td>', 'Nice concept, well executed. Great color in the sunrise, and nice constrast against the ground, which is lit just enough by the lightening sky.', '2013-02-05 00:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972068, 1051313, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple concept. Poor confused plant - winter? spring?</td>', 'Nice, simple concept. Poor confused plant - winter? spring?', '2013-02-05 00:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972069, 1052230, 77196, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The find-a-sheep "game" adds emphasis to it being lost, and the good shepherd having to put an effort into looking for it. But, the monochrome picture, with branches and tree trunks going everywhere also convey the lostness. Very nicely done.</td>', 'I really like this. The find-a-sheep "game" adds emphasis to it being lost, and the good shepherd having to put an effort into looking for it. But, the monochrome picture, with branches and tree trunks going everywhere also convey the lostness. Very nicely done.', '2013-02-05 00:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972071, 1051668, 77196, '<td valign="top">I really like the way my eye is drawn into the picture. Very effective use of black &amp; white. Not sure I''d equate a church with heaven, and he doesn''t look much like an angel. But, it was a dream, after all; wasn''t it?</td>', 'I really like the way my eye is drawn into the picture. Very effective use of black & white. Not sure I''d equate a church with heaven, and he doesn''t look much like an angel. But, it was a dream, after all; wasn''t it?', '2013-02-05 00:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972073, 1051773, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. A rather westernized concept of the bread &amp; wine, but effective nonetheless. It almost seems that the wine is a tad too dark, but I like how the red gets projected onto the bread. I also like your composition on this - a bit wider than typical, but the negative space adds to the image nicely.</td>', 'Nice shot. A rather westernized concept of the bread & wine, but effective nonetheless. It almost seems that the wine is a tad too dark, but I like how the red gets projected onto the bread. I also like your composition on this - a bit wider than typical, but the negative space adds to the image nicely.', '2013-02-05 00:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972074, 1052053, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a hard expression to convey! Yet, she seems to be longingly looking back (at least away from the camera), both distressed and disappointed at the same time. And, over it all the congealing salt crystals form. Going. Going. and just before Gone.</td>', 'What a hard expression to convey! Yet, she seems to be longingly looking back (at least away from the camera), both distressed and disappointed at the same time. And, over it all the congealing salt crystals form. Going. Going. and just before Gone.', '2013-02-05 01:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972075, 1052151, 77196, '<td valign="top">OK. It is not supposed to look like anything, and it doesn''t. The bright colors draw the eye, and the mind tries to attribute meaning to it, when there apparently isn''t meaning. I''m assuming the center section is selective desat, but it shows a change happening in the midst of all the other colors. You could also view this as the colors being spun off of the central black &amp; white area. Very successful use of the abstract to communicate the message.</td>', 'OK. It is not supposed to look like anything, and it doesn''t. The bright colors draw the eye, and the mind tries to attribute meaning to it, when there apparently isn''t meaning. I''m assuming the center section is selective desat, but it shows a change happening in the midst of all the other colors. You could also view this as the colors being spun off of the central black & white area. Very successful use of the abstract to communicate the message.', '2013-02-05 01:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972077, 1051182, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a terrifying scene! I love the hand hovering above it all, and the different orientations and distortion of the faces, the use of some grave imagery to communicate the dead, and the couple walking towards the hills to communicate the living. There is too much to see. Too much to take in. A great representation of what that event may be like.</td>', 'What a terrifying scene! I love the hand hovering above it all, and the different orientations and distortion of the faces, the use of some grave imagery to communicate the dead, and the couple walking towards the hills to communicate the living. There is too much to see. Too much to take in. A great representation of what that event may be like.', '2013-02-05 01:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972078, 1052081, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative concept. Interesting trails of light, and paths of light. I especially like them not being in straight lines, but a bit wandery.</td>', 'Interesting and creative concept. Interesting trails of light, and paths of light. I especially like them not being in straight lines, but a bit wandery.', '2013-02-05 01:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972079, 1052188, 77196, '<td valign="top">A sleeper. Simple concept, nicely done.</td>', 'A sleeper. Simple concept, nicely done.', '2013-02-05 01:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972080, 1052129, 77196, '<td valign="top">Powerful image. The high key approach works very well on this. Great terror shot.</td>', 'Powerful image. The high key approach works very well on this. Great terror shot.', '2013-02-05 01:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972081, 1052158, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. I like your placement of Jesus, and the cone of light in the sky that points to him.</td>', 'Very nicely done. I like your placement of Jesus, and the cone of light in the sky that points to him.', '2013-02-05 01:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972082, 1051987, 77196, '<td valign="top">The birds seem to think he''s a ghost too. Very effective in black &amp; white.</td>', 'The birds seem to think he''s a ghost too. Very effective in black & white.', '2013-02-05 01:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972086, 1052086, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not a very friendly shot, eh? But the comparison wasn''t meant to be. Love the tweezers. Do you realize what two-eye vision gives us? Depth perception! How could you see clearly enough to try to remove a splinter without both eyes functioning well? I especially like your use of the suit, vest, and tie to convey a pompous attitude - completely oblivious to his own problem.</td>', 'Not a very friendly shot, eh? But the comparison wasn''t meant to be. Love the tweezers. Do you realize what two-eye vision gives us? Depth perception! How could you see clearly enough to try to remove a splinter without both eyes functioning well? I especially like your use of the suit, vest, and tie to convey a pompous attitude - completely oblivious to his own problem.', '2013-02-05 01:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972087, 1052013, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice execution of the concept - with both color and shape. Nicely creative.</td>', 'Very nice execution of the concept - with both color and shape. Nicely creative.', '2013-02-05 01:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972092, 1052213, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Although the original was not done on canvas, you''ve done a great job in capturing the lighting, positioning, and tones of the original; and the canvas texture just adds to the feel.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Although the original was not done on canvas, you''ve done a great job in capturing the lighting, positioning, and tones of the original; and the canvas texture just adds to the feel.', '2013-02-05 01:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972096, 1052090, 77196, '<td valign="top">No requirements for beauty, wealth. Even the poor, the plain and ordinary, during our every day lives. Asking God, in faith believing, whatever you want is available to everyone. Of course, He doesn''t give everyone everything they ask for, just as parents would probably not give a sharp pocket knife to a preschooler. The patterns on the board behind her head I find a bit distracting.</td>', 'No requirements for beauty, wealth. Even the poor, the plain and ordinary, during our every day lives. Asking God, in faith believing, whatever you want is available to everyone. Of course, He doesn''t give everyone everything they ask for, just as parents would probably not give a sharp pocket knife to a preschooler. The patterns on the board behind her head I find a bit distracting.', '2013-02-05 01:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972099, 1051777, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not the most pleasant of subject matters. A bit far from the action, but I''m not sure I''d want to see any more detail.</td>', 'Not the most pleasant of subject matters. A bit far from the action, but I''m not sure I''d want to see any more detail.', '2013-02-05 01:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972100, 1052201, 77196, '<td valign="top">Powerful image. I especially like the cloud / mist in the background, and you''ve done a masterful job blending the clay with man''s body. Do you realize that God spoke the rest of creation into being, but went hands-on when He created man?</td>', 'Powerful image. I especially like the cloud / mist in the background, and you''ve done a masterful job blending the clay with man''s body. Do you realize that God spoke the rest of creation into being, but went hands-on when He created man?', '2013-02-05 01:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972102, 1052010, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Not quite the way I imagined it, since Pharaoh seemed to think his arms could drive his chariots after his ex-slaves, but a very competent vision regardless. It definitely conveys the awe and trepidation of Moses leading the people through the middle of the waters.</td>', 'Excellent image. Not quite the way I imagined it, since Pharaoh seemed to think his arms could drive his chariots after his ex-slaves, but a very competent vision regardless. It definitely conveys the awe and trepidation of Moses leading the people through the middle of the waters.', '2013-02-05 01:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972103, 1051957, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great image. Not sure about the angel''s pose, or the lighting source consistency on the angel &amp; shepherd. But where did you rustle up the goats on such short notice. I really like that this image conveys the awesomeness of the experience - so much so that the nit-pick details are skipped over, and perhaps, serve to leave the viewer with a slight impression that "something isn''t right in this shot!"</td>', 'Great image. Not sure about the angel''s pose, or the lighting source consistency on the angel & shepherd. But where did you rustle up the goats on such short notice. I really like that this image conveys the awesomeness of the experience - so much so that the nit-pick details are skipped over, and perhaps, serve to leave the viewer with a slight impression that "something isn''t right in this shot!"', '2013-02-05 01:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972105, 1052185, 77196, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh! I like the image very much - especially that the animals are all looking different directions, like they really are searching for the ark. Like Capt. Kirk said in Star Trek IV - everyone remember where we parked.</td>', 'Made me laugh! I like the image very much - especially that the animals are all looking different directions, like they really are searching for the ark. Like Capt. Kirk said in Star Trek IV - everyone remember where we parked.', '2013-02-05 01:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972106, 1052183, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on this. Reminds me of the hypnosis scene from Aladdin (Disney).</td>', 'Great lighting on this. Reminds me of the hypnosis scene from Aladdin (Disney).', '2013-02-05 01:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972107, 1052198, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the silvery texture. Not really sure what I''m looking at, but it does convey clearly the idea of two halves of one whole, similar, but different.</td>', 'I like the silvery texture. Not really sure what I''m looking at, but it does convey clearly the idea of two halves of one whole, similar, but different.', '2013-02-05 01:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972109, 1052029, 77196, '<td valign="top">Your turn. Nicely captured - she looks like she''s at rest and would not appreciate being disturbed.</td>', 'Your turn. Nicely captured - she looks like she''s at rest and would not appreciate being disturbed.', '2013-02-05 01:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972110, 1051920, 77196, '<td valign="top">A little more splashy than the scene as described, but it leaves no doubt as to what is happening.</td>', 'A little more splashy than the scene as described, but it leaves no doubt as to what is happening.', '2013-02-05 01:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972111, 1051907, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent dirt toning on the man''s face. The lighting and composition are very nice.</td>', 'Excellent dirt toning on the man''s face. The lighting and composition are very nice.', '2013-02-05 01:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972113, 1051784, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great sky and waters. Not sure I''m buying the beard - looks too fake (shiny). And what are the 10 commandments doing in the scene? Moses packing them along just in case they might come in handy later? I do like that you have Moses with white hair (he was at least 80 at the time of the Exodus). I also like that the path through the sea is fairly wide - not just a trail. It must have been fairly wide for Pharaoh to think he could drive his army''s chariots through it. The lighting is very nice.</td>', 'Great sky and waters. Not sure I''m buying the beard - looks too fake (shiny). And what are the 10 commandments doing in the scene? Moses packing them along just in case they might come in handy later? I do like that you have Moses with white hair (he was at least 80 at the time of the Exodus). I also like that the path through the sea is fairly wide - not just a trail. It must have been fairly wide for Pharaoh to think he could drive his army''s chariots through it. The lighting is very nice.', '2013-02-05 01:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972114, 1051628, 77196, '<td valign="top">No, Jesus didn''t even portray it as that nice. Nice communication of a wrech, a sham, an imitation, something that is not as it should be. It almost looks like a disapproving face.</td>', 'No, Jesus didn''t even portray it as that nice. Nice communication of a wrech, a sham, an imitation, something that is not as it should be. It almost looks like a disapproving face.', '2013-02-05 01:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972116, 1052227, 77196, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective. Not sure I like the mottled background, but it almost looks like refractions through the water.</td>', 'Simple, effective. Not sure I like the mottled background, but it almost looks like refractions through the water.', '2013-02-05 01:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972117, 1052124, 77196, '<td valign="top">Some very nice blending of bodies with a touch of humor. Nicely done.</td>', 'Some very nice blending of bodies with a touch of humor. Nicely done.', '2013-02-05 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972118, 1052067, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a true work of craftsmanship.</td>', 'Nice capture of a true work of craftsmanship.', '2013-02-05 01:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972119, 1051828, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice fog - almost like the shape of a lobster, or other creature looking to attack the people.</td>', 'Nice fog - almost like the shape of a lobster, or other creature looking to attack the people.', '2013-02-05 01:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972120, 1052177, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''m buying the yellow tint, but this certainly conveys solitude and peace. A newly fallen snow, in a world of muted sounds, a tranquil feeling, free from fear and strife. The yellow tint does lend an air of other-worldliness to the image.</td>', 'Not sure I''m buying the yellow tint, but this certainly conveys solitude and peace. A newly fallen snow, in a world of muted sounds, a tranquil feeling, free from fear and strife. The yellow tint does lend an air of other-worldliness to the image.', '2013-02-05 01:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972292, 1052201, 109387, '<td valign="top">One the most creative images in this challenge</td>', 'One the most creative images in this challenge', '2013-02-05 09:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972295, 1051784, 109387, '<td valign="top">Great job on the water. Light and beard on the man doesn''t work...</td>', 'Great job on the water. Light and beard on the man doesn''t work...', '2013-02-05 09:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972296, 1052086, 109387, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if voters will like a modern interpretation, but this image is wonderful</td>', 'I don''t know if voters will like a modern interpretation, but this image is wonderful', '2013-02-05 09:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972297, 1052213, 109387, '<td valign="top">Easy one but well done, I like it</td>', 'Easy one but well done, I like it', '2013-02-05 09:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972298, 1052010, 109387, '<td valign="top">Glad to see you back :)<br/> <br/>Have a nice and safe journey through the Red Sea... there''s a ribbon waiting for you  ;)</td>', 'Glad to see you back :) Have a nice and safe journey through the Red Sea... there''s a ribbon waiting for you  ;)', '2013-02-05 09:43:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6972300, 1052118, 109387, '<td valign="top">Creative interpretation of the challenge!</td>', 'Creative interpretation of the challenge!', '2013-02-05 09:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972403, 1052153, 124815, '<td valign="top">You should have made a reference to Caravaggio''s painting so that everybody could appreciate the extent and quality of your work. <br/>In my view, this is the only picture worth considering in this convoluted challenge that produced so many childish or kitschy images. A professional one. <br/>You truly made a "tableau vivant" and there are parts totally remarkable, not to mention the chiaroscuro that you achieved. I don''t think that there are good reproductions of the paintings, your scene is the closest to Caravaggio than what one can find on the internet.<br/>There is just one unfortunate juxtaposition of the figures on the left side that truly exists in Caravaggio''s painting also.<br/>I particularly appreciate the treatment of all the draped scarves and clothing - you left it all painterly and did not succumb to the sharpening temptations.</td>', 'You should have made a reference to Caravaggio''s painting so that everybody could appreciate the extent and quality of your work. In my view, this is the only picture worth considering in this convoluted challenge that produced so many childish or kitschy images. A professional one. You truly made a "tableau vivant" and there are parts totally remarkable, not to mention the chiaroscuro that you achieved. I don''t think that there are good reproductions of the paintings, your scene is the closest to Caravaggio than what one can find on the internet.There is just one unfortunate juxtaposition of the figures on the left side that truly exists in Caravaggio''s painting also.I particularly appreciate the treatment of all the draped scarves and clothing - you left it all painterly and did not succumb to the sharpening temptations.', '2013-02-05 11:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6972549, 1052153, 128323, '<td valign="top">You nailed this with the dramatic shadows!  This is reminiscent of a Rembrandt painting!  Bravo!</td>', 'You nailed this with the dramatic shadows!  This is reminiscent of a Rembrandt painting!  Bravo!', '2013-02-05 16:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
