(6974077, 1052201, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow that is pretty awesome and something I could just imagine... he just needs to be a bit bigger, but nothing is too hard for God!<br/> <br/>Best on show <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1014169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/110000-114999/114285/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1014169.jpg"/></a> 10</td>', 'Wow that is pretty awesome and something I could just imagine... he just needs to be a bit bigger, but nothing is too hard for God! Best on show  10', '2013-02-07 04:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974182, 1052118, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1. <br/>This challenge had slim pickings and I always give at least one image the top score. Not saying this is good, just better then the rest. As such, you benefit with my only 10.</td>', '#1. This challenge had slim pickings and I always give at least one image the top score. Not saying this is good, just better then the rest. As such, you benefit with my only 10.', '2013-02-07 10:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974183, 1052151, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2<br/>When I initially voted, gave this a 9. The problem with these style of abstracts is my liking is entirely dependent on my mood. Right now I''m not feeling it, but will keep it where is was originally placed. <br/> <br/>At least it was different from the rest.</td>', '#2When I initially voted, gave this a 9. The problem with these style of abstracts is my liking is entirely dependent on my mood. Right now I''m not feeling it, but will keep it where is was originally placed.  At least it was different from the rest.', '2013-02-07 10:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6974186, 1051777, 144365, '<td valign="top">#3, tied with another. <br/>I would have loved to seen a better close-up of the person getting stoned. Also, the trajectory of the rocks seem off. If you''re going to stone someone, you wouldn''t toss a lobber, you''d want a direct line to smash them right in the face.</td>', '#3, tied with another. I would have loved to seen a better close-up of the person getting stoned. Also, the trajectory of the rocks seem off. If you''re going to stone someone, you wouldn''t toss a lobber, you''d want a direct line to smash them right in the face.', '2013-02-07 10:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
