(6974501, 1052177, 19825, '<td valign="top">OK, I really like this, but I suspect it may not be going well for you over all (hopefully I am wrong there). I really admire your bold choices in composition and colors in processing. Beautifully done.</td>', 'OK, I really like this, but I suspect it may not be going well for you over all (hopefully I am wrong there). I really admire your bold choices in composition and colors in processing. Beautifully done.', '2013-02-07 16:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
