(6974795, 1052010, 119863, '<td valign="top">Oh great, so there''s the blue ribbon.  Can''t give it a ten, because especially for expert editing just about every single element was a conscious decision and I think the lighting on this man''s face should have been softer and the land under the parted sea could have been better.  great work, though.</td>', 'Oh great, so there''s the blue ribbon.  Can''t give it a ten, because especially for expert editing just about every single element was a conscious decision and I think the lighting on this man''s face should have been softer and the land under the parted sea could have been better.  great work, though.', '2013-02-07 21:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
